{"seq":3,"slug":"small-reversible-changes","title":"小步可逆的变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/small-reversible-changes","wordCount":1851,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"小步可逆的变更\">小步可逆的变更</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>agent 会犯错——这是必须接受的前提。降低风险的根本办法不是「让 agent 永不犯错」，而是<strong>让每一次错误的代价足够低</strong>：改动足够小，所以容易审、容易测；足够可逆，所以出错能快速回滚。小步可逆既是一种工作方式，也是一种架构属性。本篇用 2025–2026 年的工程实践说明它为何成立、架构如何支撑可逆性、以及在并行 agent 时代如何按风险分配自主权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把「小步可逆」拆成它的两面与一条底线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>小步</strong>：改动足够小，所以容易审、容易测、容易精确定位因果；一个聚焦的小 PR 几分钟能看懂，横跨几十个文件的巨型变更只能粗略扫过。</li>\n<li><strong>可逆</strong>：改动能干净回滚时，尝试的最坏代价只是「回滚重来」——可逆性是放手的安全垫，也是架构属性。</li>\n<li><strong>超线性成本</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个小步的返工期望约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\,p\\,c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，而一个规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的大步修复成本随规模超线性增长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx P(s)\\cdot c\\,s^{\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），因为大变更里错误互相纠缠。</li>\n<li><strong>按风险分配自主权</strong>：可逆且可自动验证则全自动，反之收紧；不可逆操作（删数据、改公开契约）仅生成方案待人工确认。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小改动让审查与纠错可行\">小改动让审查与纠错可行</h2><p>改动大小直接决定审查与定位的可行性：一个聚焦的小 PR，人几分钟内能看懂「改了什么、为什么」；横跨几十个文件的巨型变更只能粗略扫过，审查退化为盖章。因果定位同理——一次只做一件事，出问题就能精确指认是哪次引入；十件事混在一个 commit 里，bug 来源无从追查。</p>\n<p>经济模型可以更清楚地解释「大爆炸」为何昂贵。设单个小步出错率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、回滚成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个小步的总返工期望约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot p \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>；而一个规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的大步，其修复成本通常随规模超线性增长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>small</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>big</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>α</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[L_{\\text{small}}] = n\\,p\\,c, \\qquad \\mathbb{E}[L_{\\text{big}}] \\approx P(s)\\cdot c\\,s^{\\alpha},\\quad \\alpha &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">small</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">big</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>超线性来自耦合：大变更里错误互相纠缠，隔离一个 bug 需要理解整个变更。这是小步在经济上的根据，而不只是审美偏好。</p>\n<p>对 agent 而言小步还有一层收益：每一步都能在有限上下文内完整完成并当步验证。Anthropic 的长时程编码实验正是这样组织的——需求被拆成 <code>feature_list.json</code> 中逐项端到端功能，编码 agent 每次会话只挑一项未完成的工作，会话结束前必须留下 git commit 与进度笔记（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents\">Effective harnesses for long-running agents</a>）。配合主干分支上短生命周期、频繁合入的工作方式（<a href=\"https://trunkbaseddevelopment.com/\">Trunk Based Development</a>），改动永远不会堆积成难以审查、难以回滚的大爆炸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可逆性让放手变理性\">可逆性让放手变理性</h2><p>可逆性是放手的安全垫：当一次改动可以干净回滚，尝试的最坏代价就只是「回滚重来」。git 官方对 worktree 子命令的一句话定义是「管理多个工作树」（<a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-worktree\">git-worktree</a>）——单个仓库派生多个独立目录、共享同一套对象库，这使「每个并行 agent 独占一棵工作树」成为近乎零成本的隔离手段。</p>\n<p>并行化确实有收益，但需要精确理解收益来源。Anthropic 的多 agent 研究系统采用 orchestrator-worker 模式，主 agent 协调、子代理并行工作：Claude Opus 4 主控加 Claude Sonnet 4 子代理的组合，在其内部研究评测中比单体 Opus 4 高出 <strong>90.2%</strong>；同时他们发现 token 用量本身解释了 80% 的性能方差（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/built-multi-agent-research-system\">How we built our multi-agent research system</a>）。而 Cognition 从相反方向给出警示：上下文必须共享、行动携带隐含决策，碎片化的多 agent 会各自做出冲突假设，因此主张单线程线性 agent（<a href=\"https://cognition.com/blog/dont-build-multi-agents\">Don&#39;t Build Multi-Agents</a>）。两相对照可以得到一个综合判断：worktree 隔离解决的是<strong>工作区冲突</strong>，解决不了<strong>任务定义漂移</strong>——代码目录可以一人一棵树，但目标与约束必须有单一来源。设计级边界为何能兜住执行隔离兜不住的语义冲突，见<a href=\"../context-and-boundaries/bounded-modules-narrow-interfaces\">有界模块与窄接口</a>。</p>\n<p>架构层面，可逆性有成熟模式可用。Martin Fowler 的 Parallel Change 把不兼容的接口变更拆成三段：expand（新旧并存地扩展）、migrate（迁移调用方）、contract（删除旧路径）（<a href=\"https://martinfowler.com/bliki/ParallelChange.html\">ParallelChange</a>）；release toggle 则允许把未完成甚至未经测试的代码作为潜伏代码发上生产，随时开关（<a href=\"https://martinfowler.com/articles/feature-toggles.html\">Feature Toggles</a>）。前者是结构维度的可逆性，后者是时间维度的可逆性；flag 生态本身也在标准化，OpenFeature 提供厂商中立的开关 API 规范（<a href=\"https://openfeature.dev/\">OpenFeature</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>默认自主度</th>\n<th>主要护栏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增独立模块 / flag 后的新功能</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>全自动 + 事后审</td>\n<td>worktree 隔离、E2E 门禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口与 schema 演进</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>半自动</td>\n<td>expand→migrate→contract 三段 PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对外 API 破坏性变更</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>人工主导</td>\n<td>版本协商、发布开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据删除 / 不可回滚迁移</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>仅生成方案</td>\n<td>dry-run 输出、双人确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"在放手与可控间平衡\">在放手与可控间平衡</h2><p>按风险分级给自主度，而不是一刀切地全放开或全锁死。其中「可自动验证」一门取决于<a href=\"tests-as-agent-guardrails\">测试作为 Agent 的护栏</a>所述的快慢门禁是否就位，决策逻辑如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[一项变更] --&gt; Q1{可逆?}&#10;    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; H[收紧&lt;br/&gt;仅生成方案 待人工确认]&#10;    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Q2{可自动验证?}&#10;    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; M[半自动&lt;br/&gt;小 PR 加人审]&#10;    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; A[全自动&lt;br/&gt;worktree 隔离 门禁绿后合入]&#10;    A --&gt; Z[事后复盘 更新风险分级]&#10;    M --&gt; Z&#10;    H --&gt; Z\">flowchart TD\n    S[一项变更] --&gt; Q1{可逆?}\n    Q1 -- 否 --&gt; H[收紧&lt;br/&gt;仅生成方案 待人工确认]\n    Q1 -- 是 --&gt; Q2{可自动验证?}\n    Q2 -- 否 --&gt; M[半自动&lt;br/&gt;小 PR 加人审]\n    Q2 -- 是 --&gt; A[全自动&lt;br/&gt;worktree 隔离 门禁绿后合入]\n    A --&gt; Z[事后复盘 更新风险分级]\n    M --&gt; Z\n    H --&gt; Z</pre><p>这套分级的隐含前提，是每一步结束时系统都停在<strong>可工作、可验证、可发布</strong>的状态——而非改到一半整体不可用。主干开发把这一点制度化：主干始终可发布，分支寿命以天计。值得强调的是，小步看似慢实则快：它避免了大变更失败后漫长的调试与痛苦回滚，单位时间的有效吞吐反而更高——这正是上式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的工程含义。难逆操作则要刻意慢下来：删数据、改公开契约、不可回滚迁移，恰恰是 agent 自主应当收紧、人工确认必须在场的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li>并行任务一人一树：<code>git worktree add ../repo-agentX -b feat/task-x</code>，各 agent 独立目录互不踩踏，且共享对象库几乎不占额外磁盘。</li>\n<li>PR 粒度对齐任务清单：一个 PR 只对应 <code>feature_list.json</code> 中的一项，commit message 引用该项编号，让审查者与回滚都有唯一锚点。</li>\n<li>兼容性改造固定三段走：expand 只增不改 → migrate 切流 → contract 删旧路，三段分别过审。</li>\n<li>每个 release toggle 建档并附带清理 ticket——潜伏代码是借来的安全，不是白拿的。</li>\n<li>不可逆操作强制方案与执行分离：agent 只产出 SQL/脚本及影响面说明，人工放行后才执行。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>小步可逆把「放手让 agent 干活」从冒险变成理性决策：错误率不变时，压低单次代价与回滚成本就压低了总损失。工作区隔离（worktree）解决并行冲突，单一任务源防止定义漂移；Parallel Change 与 release toggle 分别在结构与时间维度提供可逆性；不可逆处收紧自主，是整套体系的安全边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"小步可逆的变更","id":"小步可逆的变更"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小改动让审查与纠错可行","id":"小改动让审查与纠错可行"},{"level":2,"text":"可逆性让放手变理性","id":"可逆性让放手变理性"},{"level":2,"text":"在放手与可控间平衡","id":"在放手与可控间平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型契约与快速反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/types-contracts-fast-feedback"},"next":{"title":"机器可读的上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/context-and-boundaries/machine-readable-context"}}